B.cSb=new A.p("orderColumn",B.t,"Graph layout: numeric column giving each node's order WITHIN its lane+milestone cell (replaces plain insertion-order stacking). Drag-reorder within a cell rewrites this column; ties/missing values fall back to stable insertion order.",B.f,null)
B.d31=new A.p("allowAddStage",B.V,'Graph layout: show the "add stage" (+) affordance in the milestone header row (default on when `milestoneOrder` is NOT explicitly configured \u2014 stages are then data-derived and lexically ordered, so a new milestone value can be minted to sort strictly between two existing ones). When `milestoneOrder` IS configured, only "add at end" is offered (inserting mid-list would require editing the configured array, not a data write).',B.f,null)
B.d5k=new A.p("allowInsertStep",B.V,'Graph layout: show the "Insert step here" action on the selection toolbar when exactly one edge is selected (default true; needs `milestoneColumn`). Inserting adds a new step into the edge\'s stage (or a freshly minted midpoint stage) and rewires the edge around it; refused with a toast if it would create a cycle.',B.f,null)
