B.cMx=new A.p("column",B.t,'Column holding the Markdown text (default "body"). The cell is read on EVERY build, so a host that rewrites the content under a stable row id (a single scratch row reused per article) always re-renders \u2014 this node keeps no copy that could go stale.',B.f,null)
