B.cCc=new A.d1("crossfilter","Interactive data explorer over a bound table: per-column distribution histograms you DRAG across to select a range (a brush), TWO colour-coded cohorts (A/B) you can compare, a linked scatter (pick X/Y) coloured by cohort membership, and stat cards. Categorical columns become toggle chips. All filters cross-apply. Native port of the web agent-explorer.",B.bo9,!1)
B.cSa=new A.p("table",B.at,"Pieces table (one row per piece).",B.f,null)
