B.cBF=new A.d1("composer",'A chat-style "type a message and send" input. Unlike notepad (which edits one row in place), it APPENDS a new row each send \u2014 carrying the typed text plus preset values ($playerId/now/uuid resolved) \u2014 then clears itself. The primitive for chats, comments and logs.',B.boH,!1)
B.cT3=new A.p("table",B.at,"Table of the row to edit (defaults to the host/injected table).",B.f,null)
B.cSZ=new A.p("rowId",B.D,"Id of the row to edit (usually injected by a master-detail host). A `$selected:<table>` token binds to the board-level `selectRow` pick instead of a literal id.",B.f,null)
B.d0u=new A.p("emptyText",B.D,"Placeholder shown when nothing is selected.",B.f,null)
B.cXu=new A.p("readOnly",B.V,"Show a posted row as an un-editable read view; a row just created in the host explorer (isNew) still opens editable so its author can fill it in once.",B.f,null)
B.cZO=new A.p("compact",B.V,'Intrinsic-height, non-scrolling read view (sits as a header in a column) with an "Edit details" affordance that opens the editor.',B.f,null)
B.d2k=new A.p("layout",B.D,'Read-view layout. "chips" renders the first field as a heading, long-text fields as a truncate-on-tap line, and the rest as compact inline "Label \xb7 value" chips in a Wrap. Any other value or absent keeps the default stacked label-above-value rows.',B.f,null)
